---
import Base from "@/layouts/Base.astro";
import Icon from "@/components/Icon.astro";
---

<Base current="about" title="About — ONEXUS-Agents">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-3">About</h1>
    <p class="text-[var(--color-fg-dim)] mb-10">
      ONEXUS-Agents is the public, open-source arm of <a href="https://github.com/AllStreets/ONEXUS" class="text-[var(--color-fg)] hover:text-[var(--color-accent)] mono">ONEXUS</a> — the agentic OS kernel.
    </p>

    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="font-mono text-xs text-[var(--color-fg-mute)] uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Why this exists</h2>
      <p class="text-[var(--color-fg-dim)] mb-3">
        Agent ecosystems move fast. New repos appear daily on GitHub and Hugging Face; existing ones get superseded by stronger entrants on a weekly cadence.
        Most catalogs are static blog posts or curated lists that go stale within a month.
      </p>
      <p class="text-[var(--color-fg-dim)]">
        ONEXUS-Agents is built to keep up: a nightly crawl, a weekly rescan, a transparent score, every kept agent on its own page, and the full git history as audit trail.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="font-mono text-xs text-[var(--color-fg-mute)] uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Indexed vs. runnable</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
        <div class="panel p-5">
          <div class="font-mono text-[var(--color-fg)] mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
            <Icon name="list" size="sm" />Indexed
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-fg-dim)]">
            Every agent we discover that fits a category gets its own JSON + page.
            Browse, compare, link straight to the source. Top 500 per category form the featured ranked set;
            the long tail is searchable and addressable at the same URL shape.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="panel p-5">
          <div class="font-mono text-[var(--color-fg)] mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
            <Icon name="play" size="sm" class="text-[var(--color-accent)]" />Runnable
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-fg-dim)]">
            A subset are marked <code class="mono">runnable: true</code> with an <code class="mono">adapter_ref</code>.
            Any agent flagged with the <code class="mono">mcp</code> framework is automatically runnable.
            ONEXUS reads the catalog and dispatches to these directly.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="font-mono text-xs text-[var(--color-fg-mute)] uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Stack</h2>
      <ul class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 font-mono text-sm">
        <li class="panel p-3"><span class="text-[var(--color-fg-mute)]">site</span> · Astro 4 + Tailwind v4</li>
        <li class="panel p-3"><span class="text-[var(--color-fg-mute)]">pipeline</span> · Python 3.12 + httpx</li>
        <li class="panel p-3"><span class="text-[var(--color-fg-mute)]">ranking</span> · custom composite + quality sub-score</li>
        <li class="panel p-3"><span class="text-[var(--color-fg-mute)]">classification</span> · keyword + OpenAI gpt-5.4-mini</li>
        <li class="panel p-3"><span class="text-[var(--color-fg-mute)]">framework detection</span> · langchain · crewai · mcp · 8 more</li>
        <li class="panel p-3"><span class="text-[var(--color-fg-mute)]">storage</span> · git (catalog/*.json)</li>
        <li class="panel p-3"><span class="text-[var(--color-fg-mute)]">nightly</span> · GitHub Actions · 13:00 UTC</li>
        <li class="panel p-3"><span class="text-[var(--color-fg-mute)]">weekly rescan</span> · GitHub Actions · 17:00 UTC Sun</li>
        <li class="panel p-3"><span class="text-[var(--color-fg-mute)]">submissions</span> · issue form → auto-merge PR</li>
        <li class="panel p-3"><span class="text-[var(--color-fg-mute)]">hosting</span> · Vercel (auto-deploy)</li>
        <li class="panel p-3"><span class="text-[var(--color-fg-mute)]">bridge</span> · MCP-first</li>
        <li class="panel p-3"><span class="text-[var(--color-fg-mute)]">audit</span> · daily report + bot-failure issues</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-mono text-xs text-[var(--color-fg-mute)] uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">License</h2>
      <p class="text-[var(--color-fg-dim)] mb-2">
        Code, schema, and rankings are <a href="https://github.com/AllStreets/ONEXUS-Agents/blob/main/LICENSE" class="text-[var(--color-fg)] hover:text-[var(--color-accent)] mono">Apache-2.0</a>.
        Copyright &copy; 2026 Connor Evans.
      </p>
      <p class="text-[var(--color-fg-dim)]">
        Each catalogued agent retains its own upstream license — see the <code class="mono">license</code> field on every entry.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
